      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. On hearing both sides and perusal of the evidence on record this court answers the above issues as follows:-\n Issue No.1: In the affirmative,\n Issue No.2: In the affirmative,\n Issue No.3: As per the final order,\nVeeregowda vs Mahadevasw"
    },
    {
