      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has also got examined Kasumesha M. - MRO/Technician in Sun Orthopedic Hospital as PW.2 and got marked authorization letter, police intimation, MLC register extract and case sheet pertaining to the petitioner as per Exs.P.13 t"
    },
    {
