      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard the respondent No.2 has examined Dr.Nagesh Kumar H.B. - MRD, Jaimaruthi Hospital as RW.1 and got marked copy of MLC register extract as Ex.R.1."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "441e8cbd80114c7392aaed28c5bc5c62_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "During the cross examination of RW.1 he has stated that, the petitioner came to their hospital immediately after the accident since the spot of accident is in front of the hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f8e466567d414622ac5b836c53be6ace_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further he stated that the petitioner was under the influence of alcohol at the time of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "23dc42f336e74957a19609996aa1c775_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However the other documents on record like mahazar and sketch show that the Ashok Leyland Lorry came to the right side of the Road."
