      "annotation_id": "e6f48d9f44b24348ac77629547bbdac2_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This shows absence of any negligence on the part of the petitioner even if he was under the influence of the alcohol."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "668f12cb652b416dad71d1d91f34d6bb_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore,\nthe respondent No.2 has failed to prove that the accident was caused because of the petitioner being under the influence of alcohol."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f8cf744632224330995a302fcff69135_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the other hand, from the documents on record, the Tribunal holds that the accident was caused due to the rash and negligent driving by the driver of the Ashok Leyland Goods Carrier bearing Reg.No.KA-02-AH-5998."
    },
    {
