      "annotation_id": "172b1be8700249bb9bbafefdcdeb0ecd_115",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore,\nlooking to the earlier treatment cost and nature of injuries, evidence on record, it Veeregowda vs Mahadevaswamy S.M on 28 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/154966968/\n6 appears it would be justifiable if a"
    },
