      "annotation_id": "339a656c6f084dd0955e3e4633904ce0_122",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In order to prove the same, they examined Mr. Govindaiah H. Superintendent, Rajajinagar RTO as RW.2 and got marked authorization letter and DL extract of Mahadevaswamy SM as per Exs.R.2 and R.3.\nDuring the cross examination of RW.2 stated t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aa180ab0026e48a7a164ae7249d6beaa_123",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further the Ashok Leyland Dost vehicle bearing No.KA-02-AH-5998 is a LMV vehicle and the driver was entitled to drive the same."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "756bc4c41fd84479a9f3859c37729eff_124",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The unladen weight was 1390kg."
